Z||000002||bHooper||02-21-2000||07:17 AM||||Nice job on the Engine!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> Curiousely enough, until one week ago, I had never seen a GT with a luggage rack... well, at least I don't remember seeing one.  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||stimpy||02-21-2000||07:31 AM||||Yessir, that's my baby! Yes, the luggage rack is kinda weird, isn't it?  Can't imagine actually putting a suitcase on there, but  a large duffel bag would work. I am torn between having a nice smooth deck and having the uniqueness (is that a word) of having the luggage rack.||||reg||1
Z||000004||bHooper||02-21-2000||07:46 AM||||it can be a wrod today... as much as i prefer the spoiler, i would suggest leaveing the rack, even if you repaint the car.  it is different!||||reg||1
