Z||000006||Old Lar||02-21-2000||05:24 PM||||Is the gold paint original? It faded a real lot.  Nice color.  Were the options a wing or the luggage rack? Have to check the "Spotters Guide" to see if the luggage rack details are separated out.||||reg||14
Z||000007||M King||02-21-2000||06:18 PM||||This may be a *bit* off topic for this thread, but do the fiero spoilers use the same bolt holes that the luggage rack use??? Just wondering...||||reg||5
